.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "CSSType"
.PP
\fR\fP
.PP
TypeScript and Flow definitions for CSS, generated by \fRdata from MDN\fP\&. It provides autocompletion and type checking for CSS properties and values\&.

.PP
\fBTypeScript\fP

.PP
.PP
.nf
import type * as CSS from 'csstype';

const style: CSS\&.Properties = {
  colour: 'white', // Type error on property
  textAlign: 'middle', // Type error on value
};
.fi
.PP

.PP
\fBFlow\fP

.PP
.PP
.nf
// @flow strict
import * as CSS from 'csstype';

const style: CSS\&.Properties<> = {
  colour: 'white', // Type error on property
  textAlign: 'middle', // Type error on value
};
.fi
.PP

.PP
\fIFurther examples below will be in TypeScript!\fP
.SH "Getting started"
.PP
.PP
.nf
$ npm install csstype
.fi
.PP
